    "detailed_description": "Dribble, slam, dunk, score and win the Olympics!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShow you skills, moves and fakes in this fast-paced authentic Basketball game. On defense, steal ball from your opponents and on attack, score 2 or 3 points shoots or dunk.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain features:<br />\r\n- Single Match with Top AI game<br />\r\n- Tournament games<br />\r\n- Local 2 players games <br />\r\n- Full 3D<br />\r\n- Realistics animations<br />\r\n- Real Basketball stadiums ambient sounds<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to Play:<br />\r\n- Keyboard arrow keys, or Gamepad Joystick to Move Player<br />\r\n- Left Ctrl or Left Alt, Gamepad A Button to Pass Ball and Steal Ball<br />\r\n- Space, Gamepad B Button to Shoot and Dunk<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTime to enter competition!",
